'''Desert Mountain''' is an area in the {{Zone|Mushroom Desert}}.

{{ZoneText|Find Jake.}}

== Purpose ==
'''Desert Mountain''' is a collection of mountains on the [[Mushroom Desert]] that allows players to collect {{Item|Cactus}} and {{Item|Sand}}. [[Trapper Animals]] can also spawn in this location. The top of the mountain contains {{NPCSprite|Jake}}.

